Z||000006||loafer87gt||07-10-2001||12:01 AM||||Lou, you da man dog! I thought I was the only Amiga fanatic on the forum! I am the proud owner of a Amiga 2000, a 3000, and a 4000. I used to be hardcore into Amiga's until a couple of years ago when I got my PC. They were far ahead of their time, and sometimes I still find myself missing Deluxe Paint on the old Miggy. I never had an Atari myself, but my buddy did. The Atari Falcon was a pretty impressive piece of hardware, but was very expensive over here in Canada and it was tough to find software for it. Here is the list of computers that I have owned:<P>Apple IIe<BR>Vic 20<BR>Commodore 64 (with a modem to boot!)<BR>Amiga 2000<BR>Amiga 3000<BR>Amiga 4000<BR>PPro 200<BR>Celeron 450<BR>Pentium 3 500<BR>AMD 1.2 (I've seen the light, to bad its Windoze powered)<BR>||||reg||1
